<title>USA: CDW Computer sees strong Q1 sales outlook.</title>
<headline>CDW Computer sees strong Q1 sales outlook.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO GROVE, Ill. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>CDW Computer Centers Inc said on Wednesday its sales outlook for the first quarter was favorable, with strong sales and customer demand through the first 21 days of January.</p>
<p>The company reported fourth quarter earnings of $0.49 per share compared to $0.29 per share in the same period last year. Sales increased 46 percent to $262.2 million, it said.</p>
<p>CDW said it planned to increase its sales force and intensify its marketing efforts in the new year.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
